# Color Scheme & Theme

**Source of truth:** `lib/core/constants/app_colors.dart` (`AppColors`)
**Theme wiring:** `lib/core/utils/app_theme.dart` (`AppTheme.light` / `AppTheme.dark`)
**Context helpers:** `lib/core/extensions/theme_extension.dart`

App currently forces `ThemeMode.light` in `main.dart`. Dark tokens exist — prefer theme/extension colors so dark can be enabled later.

## Brand & neutrals (light)

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| `primary` | `#E85078` | Brand, CTAs |
| `primaryLight` | `#FDF0F3` | Soft tinted backgrounds |
| `secondary` | `#F07293` | Secondary highlights |
| `accent` | `#E03856` | High-emphasis coral |
| `background` | `#FAF7F8` | Scaffold |
| `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Cards / elevated |
| `textPrimary` | `#1E1719` | Body / titles |
| `textSecondary` | `#6B5E63` | Subtext |
| `border` | `#EEDFE3` | Dividers / borders |

## Cycle / health states

Use semantic tokens — never pick a random purple/green for cycle UI:

`period` · `ovulation` · `fertility` · `pregnancy` · `perimenopause`

Feedback: `success` · `warning` · `error` · `info`

Gradients: `appGradient`, `softGradient`, `periodGradient`, `fertilityGradient`, `ovulationGradient`, `pregnancyGradient`

## Do / Don't

```dart
// ❌ BAD — new hex when a token exists
color: Color(0xFFE85078)

// ✅ GOOD
color: AppColors.primary
// or theme-aware:
color: context.primaryColor
```

- Never introduce a second palette class or hardcoded brand hex in views
- New colors → add a named token on `AppColors`, then use it
- Prefer `AppColors` / `context.*` over `Colors.pink` / raw Material defaults for brand UI
